the player is either managed by the CPU or another player, but this game is different. You will control both characters simultaneously in real time.<br></li><li>For example, in terms of movement controls, the left stick on the gamepad controls the Paladin, while the right stick controls the Archer, allowing intuitive operation of each character with your left and right hands respectively. (Keyboard and mouse controls are also available.)<br></li><li>This control scheme enables a game experience similar to MMORPGs, where the battle progresses from multiple character perspectives simultaneously, even though it's a single-player game.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166690/extras/6ed663c01860c8000d45f52da75351c9.poster.avif?t=1752270641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166690/extras/6ed663c01860c8000d45f52da75351c9.webm?t=1752270641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166690/extras/6ed663c01860c8000d45f52da75351c9.mp4?t=1752270641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
